doc Calling a function value: cast the word to a C function pointer and call it.
    Every generated function is `W f(W _, W a, ...)`, so the pointer type
    follows from the number of arguments. Arguments are evaluated right to
    left, then the function value, as in bintables; a null one panics.

emit
  ({
  {each args reverse}
  W {it.L.v} =
  {it}
  ;
  {end}
  W {L.f} =
  {f}
  ;
  if (!{L.f}) __pk_panic_nullfn();
  ((W (*)(W
  {each args}
  , W
  {end}
  ))(intptr_t){L.f})(0
  {each args}
  , {it.L.v}
  {end}
  ); })
  @panic
